[v2.4] Correct SimFin field mappings - 2026-05-27
- Derived eps_diluted from Net Income (Common) / Shares (Diluted) because SimFin income-quarterly export lacks EPS
- Derived total_debt from short_term_debt + long_term_debt because SimFin balance-quarterly export lacks Total Debt
