[v2.5] Cashflow proxy (scheme A) - 2026-05-27
- When SimFin quarterly cashflow has no explicit CapEx/FCF: derive from \"Change in Fixed Assets & Intangibles\" in quant/pipeline/fetch_simfin.py
- capital_expenditure = max(0, -change); free_cash_flow = operating_cash_flow + change; documented in README.md
- fcf_yield / sector_rank_fcf_yield use TTM free_cash_flow when this proxy is present
- Backtest scoring uses prepare_feature_matrix (same inf/clip as training) so model.predict does not fail on raw rows

